# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# Catatan lokal tidak di-track, tapi dokumentasi API/DB yang di-generate ikut di-commit.
docs/*
!docs/api/

# artefak parser @dbml/core
dbml-error.log

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.js

# testing
/coverage

